# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# No full script-src CSP: AdSense + Google's CMP load from a long, changing list
# of Google domains. These cover clickjacking and the cheap wins without
# risking breaking ad serving. (HSTS is implicit: .dev is on the HSTS preload list.)
#
# The build appends one block per Markdown copy (/swap.md, …: text/markdown,
# noindex, a canonical Link to the HTML page) and for /llms.txt and
# /llms-full.txt to dist/_headers (scripts/static-content.mjs).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), usb=(), payment=()
